# Who reviews what. GitHub requests a review from the owners of every path a
# pull request touches; with branch protection's "Require review from Code
# Owners" on, their approval is needed to merge.
#
# Everything is owned by the repository owner to start. As people join, give
# each area its own owner (a person or a team, e.g. @org/design-system) by
# replacing the handle on that line. Later lines win over earlier ones.

